cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "InfoGeometry: A Lean 4 Formalization of Noncommutative Information Geometry, Peirce-Weyl Operator Algebras, and Inductive Colimits"
version: "1.24.0"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
repository-code: "https://github.com/nickgou-nuke/info-geometry-lean"
url: "https://github.com/nickgou-nuke/info-geometry-lean"
abstract: >
  Lean 4 (v4.34.1 / Mathlib) formalization of noncommutative information geometry, division-free
  Peirce-Weyl units, Drazin and Moore-Penrose spectral splittings, Jordan-Lie operator multiplication
  closure, weighted KMS trace identities, Grassmannian Ehresmann gauge connections, and categorical
  UHF inductive colimits over involutive rings.
